01:23:12.994 --> 01:23:22.994
But you know that you're taking chances. You say, well, now sheikh has to come to Tora, I'm going to take chances. I'm going to take chances.

cue0009314
01:23:22.994 --> 01:23:37.994
It also doesn't feel like what he said, like I can decide to be a lawyer, or maybe a doctor, you know, go and try in a legal field and try to settle the time, make a lot of money and the staff, or we can just be sanitation guy, have a certain plan of something.

cue0009315
01:23:37.994 --> 01:23:46.554
