cue0009330
01:25:49.688 --> 01:26:04.688
This is as much as your brain goes. The Mubarak will give you as much reward for you reading Tehillim as for Mr. Piloni reading Ma'aseh Merkava.

cue0009331
01:26:04.688 --> 01:26:05.688
It's as much as you want.

cue0009332
