cue0009335
01:26:32.688 --> 01:26:39.688
I will tell you why you should study Mahasem al-Kabah. The reward will be less, and for the other person read just Teyillim. Why?

cue0009336
01:26:39.688 --> 01:26:49.688
The other person did this Almos and you didn't do your Almos. You could have studied Massev HaKavam, go one step up, ten steps up, whatever it is, and you didn't.

cue0009337
01:26:49.688 --> 01:27:00.688
So again, not every person, this is a question of individuation, every person has a function, has a personality, and has to develop this personality of their Almos.

cue0009338
